WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.000
I feel like what provoked that change

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.450
was Justin sat down

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:07.700
and put all these pens on the table

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:12.100
and said, "These are all the things you're doing right now,

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:15.950
and these are the things you should be focusing on."

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:20.200
And it was such a relief to us.
